    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="86aa83f5-d1fa-5094-8154-4b6b91231663" activityNameId="a931f6b5-4a17-5189-bfbd-7278e1310b60" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Packaging, corrugated board, mixed fibre, single wall, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Packaging, corrugated board, mixed fibre, single wall, at plant
This is an example for the production of boxes out of corrugated board. The user can establish himself further boxes based on the information in this step.;
UUID: 9aecfc60-086e-3635-b287-a8e0e48c548b
This module includes the production of boxes out of corrugated board. It contains the steps of cutting, folding and printing. Besides the input of corrugated board, inks and glues are considered as well as the electricity consumption.
Location: Average data from 6 large and 3 small producers in Switzerland
Technology: Average of the used technology within the examined Swiss producers
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9aecfc60-086e-3635-b287-a8e0e48c548b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
